# Normalize all text to LF in the repo AND on checkout, including on Windows
# (where core.autocrlf=true is the default).
#
# This is not cosmetic. docker/*.sh is bind-mounted into Linux containers and
# executed by /bin/sh; with CRLF endings `set -eu` becomes `set -eu<CR>` and the
# script dies immediately with "set: Illegal option -", so model provisioning
# silently never runs. Verified by running a CRLF copy in the ollama image.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep the lockfile byte-stable across platforms.
uv.lock -text
